"Can the router compose multiple chunks when the query requires several facts rather than selecting one dominant adapter?",
"What is the latency and memory overhead of scoring all chunks before each query at 64K-token scale and beyond?",
"Would repeated seeds preserve the same family-level separation and reduce the observed zero-accuracy collapse mode?"
],
